Copied verbatim:
  assets/grok-build/grok-night.tmTheme
    from crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager-render/assets/grok-night.tmTheme
  assets/grok-build/grok-day.tmTheme
    from crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager-render/assets/grok-day.tmTheme
  assets/grok-build/Swift.sublime-syntax
    from crates/codegen/xai-grok-markdown/assets/Swift.sublime-syntax
    (itself vendored by grok-build from bat v0.25.0's extra syntaxes,
    quiqueg/Swift-Sublime-Package, with grok-build's interpolation patch)

Ported, with changes noted at the top of each file:
  build.rs                  <- xai-grok-markdown/build.rs
  src/grok/syntax.rs        <- xai-grok-markdown/src/syntax.rs
  src/grok/open_code.rs     <- xai-grok-markdown/src/open_code_highlighter.rs
  src/grok/color.rs         <- xai-grok-pager-render/src/theme/color_support.rs,
                               src/render/color.rs, src/syntax.rs,
                               src/terminal/mod.rs (truecolor brands)
  src/grok/appearance.rs    <- xai-grok-pager-render/src/theme/env_appearance.rs,
                               osc11.rs, system_appearance.rs, cache.rs
  src/grok/theme.rs         <- xai-grok-pager-render/src/syntax.rs,
                               src/theme/groknight.rs, src/theme/grokday.rs,
                               src/theme/md_style.rs (transcript colors)
  coder-terminal/src/components/diff.rs
                            <- xai-grok-pager/src/scrollback/blocks/tool/edit.rs
  coder-terminal/src/components/turn.rs
                            <- xai-grok-pager/src/scrollback/blocks/user.rs,
                               blocks/agent.rs, wrappers/entry_renderer.rs,
                               state/layout.rs (gaps), and
                               xai-grok-pager-render/src/theme/md_style.rs
  coder-terminal/src/components/run.rs (tool row colors)
                            <- xai-grok-pager/src/scrollback/blocks/tool/*.rs,
                               wrappers/entry_renderer.rs (dimmed bullet),
                               xai-grok-pager-render/src/render/color.rs
                               (blend_color)
  coder-terminal/src/markdown.rs (tables, links, quote bars, rules)
                            <- xai-grok-markdown/src/parse.rs, src/style.rs
  coder-terminal/src/ladder.rs (the #141414 field)
                            <- xai-grok-pager-render/src/theme/groknight.rs
  coder-terminal/src/grok_spinner.rs
                            <- xai-grok-pager-render/src/glyphs.rs
                               (braille_spinner_frames),
                               xai-grok-pager/src/views/turn_status.rs
                               (SPINNER_DIVISOR, render_starting_session),
                               xai-grok-pager-render/src/util.rs
                               (format_duration),
                               src/theme/groknight.rs (gray_dim)

